    "title": "[PJRT] Add a ExecuteChunk method that allows the user to execute a single chunk of the transpose only.",
    "user": "copybara-service[bot]",
    "created_at": "2025-12-16T17:59:48",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-19T14:48:34",
    "body": "[PJRT] Add a ExecuteChunk method that allows the user to execute a single chunk of the transpose only.\n\nThe current Execute() method executes all the chunks at one time. This refactoring is in preparation for software pipelining transposes with DMAs. Execute() now calls ExecuteChunk() for each chunk.\n",
