    "number": 106740,
    "title": "[XLA:GPU] Hoist fused bitcasts across transposes with size-1 dimensions.",
    "user": "copybara-service[bot]",
    "created_at": "2025-12-19T11:00:24",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-19T14:45:37",
    "body": "[XLA:GPU] Hoist fused bitcasts across transposes with size-1 dimensions.\n\nThis change allows the hoist_fused_bitcasts pass to handle bitcasts that introduce or remove size-1 dimensions when they are fused with transposes. Size-1 dimensions are now ignored when checking for contiguity and are dropped from the shapes of the new bitcast/transpose created during hoisting.\n",
